  "chapter": 632,
  "signer": "KATHY HOCHUL",
  "text": " \n                APPROVAL MEMORANDUM - No. 68 Chapter 632\n \n       MEMORANDUM filed with Assembly Bill Number 9259, entitled:\n \n    \"AN ACT to amend the agriculture and markets law, in relation to the\n        definitions  of  surplus  agricultural  products  and  processed\n        products for the purposes of the Nourish New York program\"\n \n    APPROVED\n \n  This bill  would  add  to  the  definition  of  \"Surplus  agricultural\nproducts\" to clarify that whole milk and two percent fat milk are eligi-\nble for the Nourish NY program.\n \n  I fully support the goals of this bill, and I was proud to sign legis-\nlation  in 2021 to make Nourish New York permanent. However, changes are\nnecessary to ensure there is no confusion that milk  and  milk  products\nare included in the Nourish New York program.\n\n  I have reached an agreement with the Legislature to enact these chang-\nes.  On the basis of this agreement, I am pleased to sign this bill.\n \n  This bill is approved.                         (signed) KATHY HOCHUL\n \n                                ______\n",
  "year": 2024
 },
